{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUSHCRAFT SURVIVAL</strong> is a hardcore bush-crafting survival game, set in Canada's icy northern wilderness. In <strong>Survival Mode</strong>, an endless boreal forest is generated each time a new play session starts. In <strong>Sandbox Mode</strong> you can have total control over your trek in the wilderness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See how many days you can survive solo, or with <strong>up to 4 friends in local co-op multiplayer</strong>, in spite of snow storms, injuries and unexpected setbacks! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529110/extras/c2b4b11733fa0cfa8cc1f1128a5ac410.avif?t=1773889821\" width=616 height=90 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529110/extras/abc08d0127ecd2a6fda245e92ba2268c.poster.avif?t=1773889821\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529110/extras/abc08d0127ecd2a6fda245e92ba2268c.webm?t=1773889821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529110/extras/abc08d0127ecd2a6fda245e92ba2268c.mp4?t=1773889821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use primitive resources such as logs, bark and moss to build bushcraft shelters, protecting you from the frigid cold of the night. Read the Bushcraft Guide to become a master crafter and builder in this harsh climate.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd28 Build a shelter to take cover from the rain and snow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca7 Getting wet in freezing temperatures can be a life sentence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 Set a fire near your shelter to dry off your clothes and get some feeling back in your fingers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529110/extras/a5e75a1ea4765f3734ded7731a080312.avif?t=1773889821\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529110/extras/2754dcd3e47fa85958cea1e1dc8fffe4.poster.avif?t=1773889821\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529110/extras/2754dcd3e47fa85958cea1e1dc8fffe4.webm?t=1773889821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529110/extras/2754dcd3e47fa85958cea1e1dc8fffe4.mp4?t=1773889821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gathering resources is at the core of surviving in Bushcraft Survival. You'll need to start collecting logs, firewood, bark, and tinder right away if you want to survive this harsh environment.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udeb5 Only carry what you can hold. Larger items such as firewood and logs have a carry limit that you must respect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f While chopping down trees and whittling bark, keep an eye on your tool's sharpness and life. If it becomes blunt, it may break, leaving you without a way to start a fire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc1f Fishing and trapping will be your primary way of gathering food resources. Cook on an open fire to rid your food of pathogens and avoid getting sick.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529110/extras/54b6b1ba0d65ae101b93da2006a3b6eb.poster.avif?t=1773889821\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529110/extras/54b6b1ba0d65ae101b93da2006a3b6eb.webm?t=1773889821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529110/extras/54b6b1ba0d65ae101b93da2006a3b6eb.mp4?t=1773889821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529110/extras/b3689a572fc26b30086a54a3b6b17465.avif?t=1773889821\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529110/extras/b27735083325ee7b9bfa1e0a4dfcd4fe.poster.avif?t=1773889821\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529110/extras/b27735083325ee7b9bfa1e0a4dfcd4fe.webm?t=1773889821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529110/extras/b27735083325ee7b9bfa1e0a4dfcd4fe.mp4?t=1773889821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core loop of the game is to survive. But going beyond survival, you will want to master your craft and upgrade tools in the Skill Tree.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfe0 In order to find new tools in the game, you must seek out Public Use Cabins. Inside you will find resources to sustain you and new tools which you can use in further rounds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcaa Get additional perks, like increased efficiency, tool resiliency and reduced operation time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529110/extras/49c0f7e462da0f7b3ad125a5b9d5545f.poster.avif?t=1773889821\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529110/extras/49c0f7e462da0f7b3ad125a5b9d5545f.webm?t=1773889821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529110/extras/49c0f7e462da0f7b3ad125a5b9d5545f.mp4?t=1773889821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529110/extras/e8d877d796532ef89835f881b1439e97.avif?t=1773889821\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529110/extras/b862265daa89ab13afb27ad7a5036e9c.poster.avif?t=1773889821\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529110/extras/b862265daa89ab13afb27ad7a5036e9c.webm?t=1773889821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529110/extras/b862265daa89ab13afb27ad7a5036e9c.mp4?t=1773889821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bushcraft Survival is a passion project made by a solo developer from a small province in Canada called Newfoundland. Growing up building simple log cabins in the woods, sitting by the fire and staring up at the night sky full of stars, and tagging along hunting expeditions have all been core ingredients for the makeup of this game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529110/extras/4a7caf6da469640a9e1a7d4122cfb34c.avif?t=1773889821\" width=616 height=90 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join the discord</strong>, and feel free to ask any questions about the game or its development under BUSHCRAFT-SURVIVAL in #chat!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3529110?t=1773889821","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3529110?t=1773889821","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529110/634139f1f8a18147be30d79da5fa99be55341b44/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773889821","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529110/634139f1f8a18147be30d79da5fa99be55341b44/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773889821","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUSHCRAFT SURVIVAL</strong> is a hardcore bush-crafting survival game, set in Canada's icy northern wilderness. In <strong>Survival Mode</strong>, an endless boreal forest is generated each time a new play session starts. In <strong>Sandbox Mode</strong> you can have total control over your trek in the wilderness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See how many days you can survive solo, or with <strong>up to 4 friends in local co-op multiplayer</strong>, in spite of snow storms, injuries and unexpected setbacks! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529110/extras/c2b4b11733fa0cfa8cc1f1128a5ac410.avif?t=1773889821\" width=616 height=90 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529110/extras/abc08d0127ecd2a6fda245e92ba2268c.poster.avif?t=1773889821\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529110/extras/abc08d0127ecd2a6fda245e92ba2268c.webm?t=1773889821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529110/extras/abc08d0127ecd2a6fda245e92ba2268c.mp4?t=1773889821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use primitive resources such as logs, bark and moss to build bushcraft shelters, protecting you from the frigid cold of the night. Read the Bushcraft Guide to become a master crafter and builder in this harsh climate.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd28 Build a shelter to take cover from the rain and snow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca7 Getting wet in freezing temperatures can be a life sentence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 Set a fire near your shelter to dry off your clothes and get some feeling back in your fingers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529110/extras/a5e75a1ea4765f3734ded7731a080312.avif?t=1773889821\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor