graph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529110/extras/b3689a572fc26b30086a54a3b6b17465.avif?t=1773889821\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529110/extras/b27735083325ee7b9bfa1e0a4dfcd4fe.poster.avif?t=1773889821\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529110/extras/b27735083325ee7b9bfa1e0a4dfcd4fe.webm?t=1773889821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529110/extras/b27735083325ee7b9bfa1e0a4dfcd4fe.mp4?t=1773889821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core loop of the game is to survive. But going beyond survival, you will want to master your craft and upgrade tools in the Skill Tree.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfe0 In order to find new tools in the game, you must seek out Public Use Cabins. Inside you will find resources to sustain you and new tools which you can use in further rounds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcaa Get additional perks, like increased efficiency, tool resiliency and reduced operation time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529110/extras/49c0f7e462da0f7b3ad125a5b9d5545f.poster.avif?t=1773889821\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529110/extras/49c0f7e462da0f7b3ad125a5b9d5545f.webm?t=1773889821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529110/extras/49c0f7e462da0f7b3ad125a5b9d5545f.mp4?t=1773889821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529110/extras/e8d877d796532ef89835f881b1439e97.avif?t=1773889821\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529110/extras/b862265daa89ab13afb27ad7a5036e9c.poster.avif?t=1773889821\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529110/extras/b862265daa89ab13afb27ad7a5036e9c.webm?t=1773889821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529110/extras/b862265daa89ab13afb27ad7a5036e9c.mp4?t=1773889821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bushcraft Survival is a passion project made by a solo developer from a small province in Canada called Newfoundland. Growing up building simple log cabins in the woods, sitting by the fire and staring up at the night sky full of stars, and tagging along hunting expeditions have all been core ingredients for the makeup of this game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529110/extras/4a7caf6da469640a9e1a7d4122cfb34c.avif?t=1773889821\" width=616 height=90 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join the discord</strong>, and feel free to ask any questions about the game or its development under BUSHCRAFT-SURVIVAL in #chat!</p>","developers":["Michael Jared Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indi